{"id":"b1587d880757e9dd","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-special-class-exists.md","title":"非空特殊类存在","display":"thm-special-class-exists — 非空特殊类存在","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-special-class-exists","aliases":["20-thm-special-class-exists"],"display":"thm-special-class-exists — 非空特殊类存在","chapter":"9","section":"9.3","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Theorem 9.3.2(ii)；对角例子的本地证明","source_pdf_pages":[208],"source_printed_pages":[176],"depends_on":["[[20-df-special-class]]","[[20-df-separator]]","[[20-thm-separation-class]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-special-class-exists"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-special-class-exists</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-special-class-exists — 非空特殊类存在"},{"key":"chapter","html":"9"},{"key":"section","html":"9.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 9.3.2(ii)；对角例子的本地证明"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>208</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>176</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"17bb91b14aad762c\" href=\"?note=17bb91b14aad762c\" title=\"20-df-special-class\">20-df-special-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9f5c300501e65ad4\" href=\"?note=9f5c300501e65ad4\" title=\"20-df-separator\">20-df-separator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e8895988307cce12\" href=\"?note=e8895988307cce12\" title=\"20-thm-separation-class\">20-thm-separation-class</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=\\{e:\\varphi_e(e)\\downarrow=0\\}\">\\(A=\\{e:\\varphi_e(e)\\downarrow=0\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B=\\{e:\\varphi_e(e)\\downarrow=1\\}\">\\(B=\\{e:\\varphi_e(e)\\downarrow=1\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"17bb91b14aad762c\" href=\"?note=17bb91b14aad762c\" title=\"20-df-special-class\">20-df-special-class</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9f5c300501e65ad4\" href=\"?note=9f5c300501e65ad4\" title=\"20-df-separator\">20-df-separator</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e8895988307cce12\" href=\"?note=e8895988307cce12\" title=\"20-thm-separation-class\">20-thm-separation-class</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}special\\text{-}class\\text{-}exists}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{CompInseparable}(A,B),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Special}(\\{S:\\operatorname{Separates}(S;A,B)\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}special\\text{-}class\\text{-}exists}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{CompInseparable}(A,B),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Special}(\\{S:\\operatorname{Separates}(S;A,B)\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>两集合 c.e. 且不交。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_S=\\varphi_i\">\\(\\chi_S=\\varphi_i\\)</span> 分离它们，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_S(i)=0\">\\(\\chi_S(i)=0\\)</span> 迫使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in A\">\\(i\\in A\\)</span>，取 1 则迫使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in B\">\\(i\\in B\\)</span>，均矛盾。至少 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 自身作为任意集合可分离这对，所以路径类非空。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 9.3.2(ii)；对角例子的本地证明；印刷页 176；PDF 第 208 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-special-class","status":"resolved","id":"17bb91b14aad762c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-special-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-separator","status":"resolved","id":"9f5c300501e65ad4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-separator]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-separation-class","status":"resolved","id":"e8895988307cce12","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-separation-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-special-class","status":"resolved","id":"17bb91b14aad762c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-special-class]]；see [[20-df-separator]]；see [[20-thm-separation-class]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-separator","status":"resolved","id":"9f5c300501e65ad4","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-special-class]]；see [[20-df-separator]]；see [[20-thm-separation-class]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-separation-class","status":"resolved","id":"e8895988307cce12","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-special-class]]；see [[20-df-separator]]；see [[20-thm-separation-class]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A=\\{e:\\varphi_e(e)\\downarrow=0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"B=\\{e:\\varphi_e(e)\\downarrow=1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}special\\text{-}class\\text{-}exists}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{CompInseparable}(A,B),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Special}(\\{S:\\operatorname{Separates}(S;A,B)\\}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\chi_S=\\varphi_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_S(i)=0","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in A","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in B","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false}],"bytes":1333,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["17bb91b14aad762c","9f5c300501e65ad4","e8895988307cce12"]}